        "original_id": "d0bb7a9b-0f51-5a2a-804a-9d2bf43266de",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Winnie the Pooh (2011 film), Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book (1994 film)\n- Companies: Walt Disney Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Stephen Sommers, Edward S. Feldman, Raju Patel, Ronald Yanover, Mark Geldman, Travis Oates, Jim Cummings\n- Topics: film production, directing, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book is a 1994 live-action American adventure film.\n- Stephen Sommers co-wrote and directed Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book.\n- Edward S. Feldman and Raju Patel produced Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book from a story by Ronald Yanover and Mark Geldman.\n- Winnie the Pooh is a 2011 American animated buddy musical comedy film.\n- Walt Disney Animation Studios produced Winnie the Pooh, and Walt Disney Pictures released it.\n- Travis Oates and Jim Cummings were the only two original voice actors to return for the 2011 Winnie the Pooh movie.",
